@host = http://localhost:8080
@masterKey = replace-locally-never-commit-the-real-master-key
@adminUser = admin.local
@adminPassword = replace-locally-never-commit-the-real-password
@token = paste-the-access-token-returned-by-login
@categoryId = paste-a-category-id-returned-by-the-api
@measurementUnitId = paste-a-measurement-unit-id-returned-by-the-api
@productId = paste-a-product-id-returned-by-the-api

### Instalación inicial (solo funciona mientras no exista ningún usuario)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/setup
Content-Type: application/json
X-ControlPlus-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "establishmentName": "Nombre local del establecimiento",
  "establishmentIdentification": "IDENTIFICACION-LOCAL",
  "installationCode": "INSTALACION-LOCAL",
  "installationSerial": "SERIE00001",
  "terminalCode": "TERMINAL-01",
  "terminalName": "Terminal principal",
  "userName": "{{adminUser}}",
  "displayName": "Administrador local",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Inicio de sesión
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "{{adminUser}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Recuperación excepcional del Administrador inicial
# Solo cuando no exista ningún Administrador activo y no bloqueado.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/recover-initial-administrator
Content-Type: application/json
X-ControlPlus-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "userName": "{{adminUser}}",
  "newPassword": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Usuario autenticado
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Usuarios
GET {{host}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Roles
GET {{host}}/api/roles?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Permisos
GET {{host}}/api/permissions?page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Auditoría
GET {{host}}/api/audit-records?page=1&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Categorías activas
GET {{host}}/api/categories?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoría
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Categoría local",
  "description": null
}

### Unidades de medida
GET {{host}}/api/measurement-units
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Productos disponibles (oculta agotados)
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar producto (incluye agotados)
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=CODIGO-LOCAL&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear producto con código de barras generado
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "measurementUnitId": "{{measurementUnitId}}",
  "supplierId": null,
  "internalCode": "CODIGO-LOCAL",
  "barcode": null,
  "barcodeFormat": null,
  "generateBarcode": true,
  "name": "Producto local",
  "description": null,
  "retailPrice": 0,
  "wholesalePrice": null,
  "taxPercentage": null,
  "minimumStock": 0
}

### Consultar producto
GET {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial oficial de costos de compra (requiere PRODUCTS.COSTS_READ)
GET {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/purchase-cost-history?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
